shortdesc BibTeX style for biology journals
longdesc The style is a development of apalike.bst in the BibTeX bundle.
longdesc The style serves two journals -- if the user executes
longdesc "\nocite{TitlesOn}", the style serves for the Journal of
longdesc Theoretical Biology; otherwise it serves for the Journal of
longdesc Molecular Biology.
